From a91f1f0ef28f6f1415f7e9da1950d8a8cd46a42d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dardiao <xn--6s1a@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 02:23:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] local: give a fresh instance the site's own admin name
 and site name
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The setup block was the example's, so every new database was created with the admin account
"lemmy" and the site name "lemmy-dev". Point it at 牛马俱乐部 / niuma, use a placeholder
password (this file ships with the source - a real deployment should use the setup wizard),
and document that the username is permanent after setup and has to be latin/digits/underscore.
---
 docker/lemmy.hjson | 11 +++++++++--
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docker/lemmy.hjson b/docker/lemmy.hjson
index 8827c9e..c9e9187 100644
--- a/docker/lemmy.hjson
+++ b/docker/lemmy.hjson
@@ -5,10 +5,17 @@
   # This is a minimal lemmy config for the dev / main branch. Do not use for a 
   # release / stable version.
 
+  # 这个块只在空库首次启动时生效。用户名一旦建站就固定了：Lemmy 不支持改名，
+  # 因为用户名是账号 ActivityPub 身份（https://<host>/u/<name>）的一部分。
+  # 用户名也只能用拉丁字母、数字、下划线——中文名请放到"显示名"里。
+  #
+  # 正式部署建议把这块留空，首次启动用网页建站向导自己填（本文件会随源码公开，
+  # 写在这里的密码等于公开）。
   setup: {
-    admin_username: "lemmy"
+    admin_username: "niuma"
+    # 本地开发用的占位密码，正式环境不要用
     admin_password: "lemmylemmy"
-    site_name: "lemmy-dev"
+    site_name: "牛马俱乐部"
   }
   database: {
     connection: "postgres://lemmy:password@postgres:5432/lemmy"
-- 
2.54.0

